# Runtime artifacts — regenerated by run_bench.py.
fixture-project/
# Bulky per-run agent transcripts stay ignored; the summary report, the raw
# results.jsonl, and the run log ARE checked in — they're the SPIKE-73 paper's
# cited evidence (the 72-cell 2026-06-29 run). Don't let this vanish again.
results/*
!results/report.md
!results/results.jsonl
!results/matrix_run.log
# Dated re-runs / replications are kept too (report-YYYY-MM-DD.md etc.)
!results/report-*.md
!results/results-*.jsonl
!results/replication-*.md
